13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# Email Marketing ROI: How to Calculate and Maximize Your Return on Investment"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Excerpt:"}]," Email marketing delivers ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"$$36 for every $1 spent"}]," on average -- a staggering 3,600% ROI (DMA, *2023 Email Marketing Benchmark Report*). Yet despite this proven performance, many businesses struggle to *accurately calculate* or *consistently maximize* their email ROI. This guide cuts through the noise with precise ROI formulas, realistic attribution models, and battle-tested strategies -- all backed by data and designed for immediate implementation."]}],["$","hr","4",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","6",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Why Email Marketing ROI Is Often Misunderstood (and Miscalculated)"}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Email is frequently mislabeled as \"low-cost\" or \"free\" -- especially when using platforms like Mailchimp's free tier or built-in CRM tools. But true ROI accounting must include *all* costs:"]}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Platform fees"}]," (e.g., Klaviyo at $20-$300+/month based on list size)"]}],["$","p","11",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Design & copywriting labor"}]," (even internal time: 2 hrs/week × $50/hr = $4,800/year)"]}],["$","p","12",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"A/B testing tools & analytics subscriptions"}],""]}],["$","p","13",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"List hygiene services"}]," (e.g., ZeroBounce at $19/month for 10K emails)"]}],["$","p","14",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Unsubscribe management & compliance overhead"}]," (GDPR/CCPA training, legal review)"]}],["$","p","16",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["A 2022 HubSpot study found that ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"42% of mid-market marketers exclude labor costs"}]," from their email ROI calculations -- inflating reported returns by up to 68%."]}],["$","hr","18",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","20",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"The Correct Email Marketing ROI Formula (With Real-World Example)"}],["$","p","22",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The standard ROI formula applies -- but must be adapted for marketing's multi-touch reality:"]}],["$","p","24",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["```math"]}],["$","p","25",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["\\text{Email Marketing ROI} = \\frac{\\text{Revenue Attributable to Email} - \\text{Total Email Costs}}{\\text{Total Email Costs}} \\times 100\\%"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3